<title>UK: CCCI adds 500 mln mark to April 2003 FRN.</title>
<headline>CCCI adds 500 mln mark to April 2003 FRN.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by joint lead managers Bayerische Hypothekenbank and HSBC Trinkaus.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CAISSE CENTRALE DU CREDIT IMMOBILIER</p>
<p> AMT  * 500 MLN DEM   BASE	 3M-LIBOR  MATURITY    11.APR.03</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 MARGIN     +15 BP    PAY DATE    30.JAN.97</p>
<p> LAST MOODY =	   ISS PRICE  100.168   FULL FEES   30 BP</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   AA-	 REOFFER    =</p>
<p> NOTES    * FUNGIBLE WITH 750 MLN DEM FRN LAUNCHED 07.MAR.96</p>
<p> LISTING    FFT	 DENOMS (K) ONE	 SALE LIMITS =</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    HOME CTRY  FRANCE    TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    10 BP     SELL CONC  10 BP     LIST FEE    10 BP</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 8863</p>
